; the inline and compiler-made members of the helper's classes that Orbiter.exe exports (helper/mfd.cpp, module.cpp, celbody.cpp,
; lpad.cpp, camera.cpp, made.cpp make them; draw.cpp's sketchpad vtable the sketchpad's; -fno-dllexport-inlines leaves them out). The
; lights' are helper functions that read the light in its layout (helper/light.cpp). A name the compiler makes no function of is the
; one it stands for: MFD2's empty destructor is MFD's, the vbase destructor of a class without virtual bases its destructor,
; ModuleNV's trivial assignment helper/module.cpp's.
